  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Observation of &quot;Rhumann&#39;s purple&quot; is a confirmatory test for the presence of proteins.&nbsp;Rhumann&#39;s purple is ninhydrin. When the proteins reacts with&nbsp;Rhumann&#39;s purple then violet precipitates are formed. This confirms the presence of proteins in the compounds.</p><p>The reaction is given below.<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/image6-07aed396-6ec6-4012-b85d-2d37d04b9a5d.jpg\" /></p>",
